%H A104739 Andrei Leonov, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23915663">Queue sieves: the Seidov rearrangement, Tchoukaillon solitaire, and Gamma-function constants for Josephus-type sieves</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%F A104739 From _Andrei Leonov_, Nov 11 2026: (Start)
%F A104739 a(n) = r(1), where r(n) = 1 and r(x) = r(x+1) + ceiling(r(x+1)/(2*x+1)) for x = n-1, n-2, ..., 1.
%F A104739 a(n) ~ C*n^(3/2), where C = sqrt(Pi)/Gamma(1/3)^(3/2) = 0.4042321135... (End)
%o A104739 (Python)
%o A104739 def a(n):
%o A104739     r = 1
%o A104739     for x in range(n-1, 0, -1): r += -(-r//(2*x+1))
%o A104739     return r
%o A104739 print([a(n) for n in range(1, 62)]) # _Andrei Leonov_, Nov 11 2026
